Dialogue: 3,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pregnant women are not factories.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:03.16,0:00:06.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Babies are not goods to be ordered.
