Dialogue: 3,0:00:06.28,0:00:09.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,There are things in our society, Mr Pritchard,
Dialogue: 3,0:00:09.99,0:00:12.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,which I believe should never be reduced
Dialogue: 3,0:00:12.51,0:00:18.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,to questions around contract and individual choice or intention.
Dialogue: 3,0:00:18.39,0:00:21.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,And I’m certain that motherhood is one of those.
